Subject: Preserve the original optimized CLR5 graph with the stock Clang20 toolchain

Runtime-only reflection-cache mutators are excluded from the DAC. The exact
upstream35a39 metadata local-allocation marker is backported for LLVM. Two
existing PAL null values receive their declared pointer types. ZapNodeType
keeps its observed original unsigned-int storage for computed native codes.
No optimization, feature, tracing or runtime-security setting is removed.
The separate official f86caa header backport remains independently pinned.

